      ],
      "content": "WENDOVER               CHURCH LANE SP 8707                                           Stable Block at Wendover House 11/224                                           School II GV Part of special school, formerly stables to Manor House. 1735. Brick, with initials and date in blue headers. Old tiled roof with large stack to RH of centre, smaller stack to LH. 2-storeys, front of 9 bays with slightly projecting gabled centre and narrow gabled projections in bays 2 and 8. Central carriage way with segmental brick arch now filled with modern windows. Date 1735 in blue bricks above, with 3-light attic casement with segmental arched heads. Flanking gables each have initials DIF in blue headers. Irregular casements to LH part, 2 bays of sash windows to RH. Small modern addition with hipped roof at RH end. Listing NGR: SP8719807290"
    }
